    "note": "GENERATED by Hidden Harbours ▸ Art ▸ Bake Shops. Do not hand-edit: every number here is read from the rigs at bake time (ADR 0021 §4), so an edit is silently undone by the next bake. Re-bake instead.",
    "writtenBy": "ShopBakeMenu",
